As of this version, there is some formal verification.

Up to now, a verification schema has been design using VHDL test software.
It compares the net-list with a behavior VHDL software.

The verification is mostly designed for the net-list because this one generates the PCB data.
However, it can verify the behavior as well.


The MAJOR advantage is it works with a post synthesis circuit.


